    <briefdescription>
<para>Structured diagnostic context for backend fallback incidents. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Unified diagnostics per Phase 3 requirements: &quot;unify diagnostics across join/clustering/raster/temporal and fallback paths&quot;</para>
<para>Contains machine-readable context for actionable error reporting:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>geometry type and operation</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>backend (GPU model, CUDA version, HIP version)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>failure reason (timeout, device OOM, driver error, etc.)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>recovery action taken (CPU fallback, retry, circuit-breaker)</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Unified diagnostics per <ref refid="geo__api__contract_8h" kindref="compound">geo_api_contract.h</ref> and Phase 3 requirements: &quot;unify diagnostics across join/clustering/raster/temporal and fallback paths&quot;</para>
<para>Contains machine-readable context for actionable error reporting:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>geometry type and operation</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>backend (GPU model, CUDA version, HIP version)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>failure reason (timeout, device OOM, driver error, etc.)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>recovery action taken (CPU fallback, retry, circuit-breaker) </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
